-WestendorfBuller2011\" class=\"citation journal cs1\">Beyer-Westendorf, J.; Buller, H. (2011). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111%2Fj.1538-7836.2011.04507.x\">\"External and internal validity of open label or double-blind trials in oral anticoagulation: better, worse or just different?\"</a>. <i>Journal of Thrombosis and Haemostasis</i>. <b>9</b> (11): <span class=\"nowrap\">2153–</span>2158. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<span class=\"id-lock-free\" title=\"Freely accessible\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111%2Fj.1538-7836.2011.04507.x\">10.1111/j.1538-7836.2011.04507.x</a></span>. <a href=\"/wiki/ISSN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISSN (identifier)\">ISSN</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://search.worldcat.org/issn/1538-7933\">1538-7933</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/PMID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"PMID (identifier)\">PMID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21920015\">21920015</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Journal+of+Thrombosis+and+Haemostasis&amp;rft.atitle=External+and+internal+validity+of+open+label+or+double-blind+trials+in+oral+anticoagulation%3A+better%2C+worse+or+just+different%3F&amp;rft.volume=9&amp;rft.issue=11&amp;rft.pages=2153-2158&amp;rft.date=2011&amp;rft.issn=1538-7933&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Apmid%2F21920015&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1111%2Fj.1538-7836.2011.04507.x&amp;rft.aulast=Beyer-Westendorf&amp;rft.aufirst=J.&amp;rft.au=Buller%2C+H.&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fdoi.org%2F10.1111%252Fj.1538-7836.2011.04507.x&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AOpen-label+trial\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ballou-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backl